</nav></div></header><main><section class="zk-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">CIRRUSCONNECT</div><h1>Cloud Connectivity for Software Partners.</h1><p>Extend your workforce software with a partner-focused cloud layer for time-clock connectivity, operations, support and integration.</p></div></section><section class="zk-section"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">PARTNER CLOUD TECHNOLOGY</div><h2>The Cloud Layer Behind the Clock Fleet.</h2><p>Connect, operate and support ZKTeco time clocks through a partner-focused cloud layer.</p></div><div class="zk-grid-4"><article class="zk-card"><h3>Device Connectivity</h3><p>Maintain a controlled connection between partner environments and supported time-clock deployments.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><h3>Fleet Visibility</h3><p>Support centralized visibility and operational management across deployed devices.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><h3>Support &amp; Diagnostics</h3><p>Give partner teams a better operational path for monitoring, troubleshooting and device support.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><h3>Integration Services</h3><p>Connect the time-clock layer with the partner’s WFM/HCM application using the architecture appropriate to the engagement.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="zk-section alt"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">PARTNER ARCHITECTURE</div><h2>Your Platform Stays Yours.</h2><p>You own the application, workflows, customer relationship and roadmap. CirrusConnect provides the specialized device-connectivity layer.</p></div><div class="zk-card" style="text-align:center;padding:34px"><strong style="font-size:19px">Your WFM / HCM Platform</strong><div style="font-size:26px;margin:13px">↕</div><strong style="color:#5b9f2e">APIs / Integration + CirrusConnect</strong><div style="font-size:26px;margin:13px">↕</div><strong style="font-size:19px">Ultima + TimeTrack + Workforce Edge</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="zk-section"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">YOUR WAY</div><h2>Choose the Integration Depth That Fits.</h2><p>Use the supported architecture that matches your product strategy and the level of control you want.</p></div><div class="zk-grid-3"><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">BUILD YOUR APP</div><h3>Platform SDK</h3><p>Build your own Android time-clock experience on supported Ultima hardware.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">ACCELERATE</div><h3>TimeTrack + APIs</h3><p>Use ZKTeco WFM’s employee-facing application to reduce specialized development.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><div class="zk-tag">CONNECT &amp; OPERATE</div><h3>CirrusConnect</h3><p>Add cloud connectivity and device-management capabilities where they fit the partner architecture.</p></article></div></div></section>
